OL,3,GNEWSABrown trout spawning site to get
OL,4,Aspecial protection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to protect a brown trout
OL,7,Fspawning "hot spot" on a rare chalk
OL,8,Friver has been completed.
OL,10,FHerts and Middlesex Wildlife Trust said
OL,11,Flarge wood feaures had been added to
OL,12,Fthe River Hiz at Ickleford, near
OL,13,FHitchin, to help accelerate water flows
OL,14,Fand create areas of "shaggy cover" to
OL,15,Fbenefit the fish.
OL,17,FThe work follows a seven-year project
OL,18,Fto restore a 4.3-mile (7km) stretch of
OL,19,Fthe River Ash at the Easneye Estate,
OL,20,Fnear Hertford, to its original course.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
