OL,3,GNEWSABrown trout spawning site to get
OL,4,Aspecial protection
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Perry, from the trust, said:
OL,7,F"These unique ecosystems support a rich
OL,8,Fdiversity of wildlife and some of our
OL,9,Fmost vulnerable species, including
OL,10,Fwater voles, wild brown trout and
OL,11,Faquatic plants such as water crowfoot."
